-- The exact components allowed to depend on hetoimasia-foundation:owner-tx-issuer,
-- the ownership transactions' issuer bridge, in Cabal's field syntax.
-- tools/owner-tx-guard (the test.owner-tx-guard group) refuses an unlisted or
-- stale entry, a component listed twice, and any Cabal re-export or mixin of
-- the bridge or its representation. What a listed component's modules import,
-- export and instantiate is checked by issuer review; see
-- docs/validation.md#the-issuer-bridges-import-guard.

dependent
  component: hetoimasia-foundation:test:foundation-tests
  reason: its composition example builds through the bridge
